<title>UK: BOC falls as Kleinwort downgrades to &quot;sell&quot;.</title>
<headline>BOC falls as Kleinwort downgrades to &quot;sell&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BOC Group Plc fell on Friday as analysts at Kleinwort Benson cut profit estimates and downgraded the stock to a &quot;sell&quot; rating from &quot;hold&quot;.</p>
<p>The shares were down 6p at 934-1/2p by 0805 GMT.</p>
</text>
